        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Femslash February Day 4! A little strapped for cash and wanting to make a quick buck, Glimmer finds herself in the seedier part of downtown, facing a crimson door that leads somewhere she didn't think she'd end up - in the arms of Vampires. Blood is a valuable commodity to the undead, and Glimmer has more than enough to sell, however, when she could face to face with the ladies of the household and their beautiful bodies feeding on her, Glimmer decides she wants more. Never did she think she'd end up not only in the arms of Vampires but in their bed too...&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
